cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GREMLIN — GReen Energy Monitoring for Large INfrastructure"
message: >
  If you use this software or its accompanying documentation, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
type: software
license: LGPL-3.0-or-later WITH LGPL-3.0-linking-exception
# TODO: set repository-code once the canonical public repository is published.
